  ["D3","Dataflowのウィンドウ処理が必要なのは。",["無限のストリームを時間で区切って集計するため","有限のバッチデータを一度にまとめて処理するため","遅延データを暗号化して保護するため","ストリームの各要素を機械学習で分類するため"],0,"ストリーミング集計の基本概念。","Why is windowing needed in Dataflow?",["To aggregate an unbounded stream by dividing it over time","To process a finite batch all at once in one go","To encrypt and protect the late-arriving data","To classify each element of the stream using machine learning"],"A core concept of streaming aggregation."],
  ["D3","ELTパイプラインでDataformを使う利点は。",["SQL変換を依存管理・テスト・Git管理できる","GUIのドラッグ操作だけでパイプラインを視覚的に構築できる","データを自動で暗号化して保護できる","Sparkクラスタを管理してETL処理できる"],0,"宣言的にBQの変換を構成できる。","What is the benefit of using Dataform in an ELT pipeline?",["SQL transforms with dependency management, tests, and Git","Build data pipelines visually using only drag-and-drop in a GUI","Automatically encrypt and protect the stored data","Manage Spark clusters to run ETL processing"],"Declaratively compose BQ transformations."],
  ["D3","パイプラインのべき等性が重要な理由は。",["再実行時に重複や不整合を防ぐため","再実行するたびに新しい行を必ず追加するため","データを暗号化して安全に保つため","処理を必ず高速化して課金を減らすため"],0,"再試行を安全にする設計原則。","Why is pipeline idempotency important?",["To prevent duplicates and inconsistencies on re-runs","To append brand-new rows on every single re-run","To encrypt the data and keep it securely safe","To always speed up the processing and reduce billing costs"],"A design principle that makes retries safe."],
  ["D3","デッドレターキューの役割は。",["処理できないメッセージを退避し後で対処する","配信できたメッセージを暗号化して保管する","受信したメッセージの配信順序を厳密に保証する","全メッセージを即座に削除して容量を空ける"],0,"Pub/Sub等で失敗メッセージを隔離する。","What is the role of a dead-letter queue?",["Sets aside unprocessable messages to handle later","Encrypts delivered messages and stores them safely","Strictly guarantees the delivery order of messages","Immediately deletes all messages to free up space"],"Isolates failed messages in Pub/Sub etc."],
  ["D3","バックフィルとは。",["過去分のデータを後から遡って処理すること","将来のデータを事前に予測して生成すること","データを暗号化して安全に保管すること","重複するレコードを検出して除去すること"],0,"パイプライン導入前の履歴データを取り込む。","What is backfill?",["Processing past data retroactively","Predicting and generating future data in advance","Encrypting data and storing it securely","Detecting and removing duplicate records"],"Ingests historical data from before the pipeline existed."],
  ["D3","オーケストレーションとスケジューリングの違いは。",["オーケストレーションは依存関係制御、スケジューリングは起動タイミング","オーケストレーションは起動時刻設定、スケジューリングは依存関係の制御","どちらもクラスタの自動スケーリングを指す用語である","両者ともデータを暗号化して安全に保護する機能である"],0,"Composerは依存DAG、Schedulerは時刻起動。","What is the difference between orchestration and scheduling?",["Orchestration controls dependencies; scheduling controls timing","Orchestration sets the start time; scheduling controls dependencies","Both are terms that refer to automatic cluster scaling","Both are features that encrypt and protect data securely"],"Composer handles dependency DAGs; Scheduler triggers by time."],
  ["D3","ストリーミング取り込みの順序保証で考慮すべきは。",["メッセージ順序とウォーターマーク/遅延データ","各パーティションのスループットとCPU使用率","メッセージの暗号化方式と鍵の定期ローテーション","ダッシュボードの配色と適切なグラフ選択"],0,"遅延データの扱いが品質に影響する。","What should you consider for ordering guarantees in streaming ingestion?",["Message order and watermarks / late data","Per-partition throughput and CPU utilization","The encryption method and periodic key rotation","Dashboard color scheme and proper chart choice"],"Handling late data affects quality."],
  ["D4","サービス境界からのデータ持ち出しを防ぐ仕組みは。",["VPC Service Controls","Identity-Aware Proxy","Organization Policy","Cloud Armor ポリシー"],0,"データ流出(exfiltration)を境界で制限する。","Which mechanism prevents data exfiltration from a service perimeter?",["VPC Service Controls","Identity-Aware Proxy","Organization Policy","Cloud Armor policies"],"Restricts exfiltration at the perimeter."],
  ["D4","データの発見・分類・統制を支援するガバナンス基盤は。",["Dataplex(データカタログ)","Cloud DLP(データ損失防止)","Analytics Hub 共有","BigQuery データ転送"],0,"メタデータ管理とガバナンスを提供。","Which governance foundation supports data discovery, classification and control?",["Dataplex (data catalog)","Cloud DLP (data loss prevention)","Analytics Hub data sharing","BigQuery Data Transfer Service"],"Provides metadata management and governance."],
  ["D4","BigQueryで列レベルのアクセス制御に使うのは。",["ポリシータグ(列レベルセキュリティ)","承認済みビュー(Authorized View)","行レベルセキュリティ(RLS)","動的データマスキング(BigQuery)"],0,"機微列へのアクセスをタグで制御する。","What does BigQuery use for column-level access control?",["Policy tags (column-level security)","Authorized views defined on the dataset","Row-level security policies (RLS)","Dynamic data masking in BigQuery"],"Controls access to sensitive columns via tags."],
  ["D4","保持ポリシー(Retention Policy)の役割は。",["一定期間オブジェクトの削除/変更を禁止する","古いオブジェクトを自動的に安価なクラスへ移す","オブジェクトを暗号化して安全に保つ","アクセス頻度を計測して課金を最適化する"],0,"コンプライアンスのため改変・削除を防ぐ。","What is the role of a retention policy?",["Forbids deletion/modification of objects for a set period","Automatically moves old objects to a cheaper storage class","Encrypts the objects and keeps them safely stored","Measures access frequency to optimize billing costs"],"Prevents alteration/deletion for compliance."],
  ["D4","監査ログ(Cloud Audit Logs)の用途は。",["誰が何にアクセスしたかを記録する","アプリの実行速度を計測してグラフ化する","課金額を毎時集計して請求書を作成する","エラーの発生を検知して自動で通知する"],0,"アクセスの可視性とコンプライアンスを支える。","What is the use of Cloud Audit Logs?",["Records who accessed what","Measures app latency and charts it","Totals hourly charges into a bill","Detects errors and sends alerts"],"Supports access visibility and compliance."],
  ["D4","サービスアカウントの適切な扱いは。",["最小権限を付与しキーを安全に管理する","オーナー権限を付与し鍵をコードに直接書く","鍵を無効化せず全員で共有して使い回す","全プロジェクトに編集者権限を一括付与する"],0,"自動処理の認証主体として最小権限で運用。","What is the proper handling of a service account?",["Grant least privilege and manage keys securely","Grant owner role and hard-code the key in code","Never disable keys and share them with everyone","Grant editor on all projects in one bulk action"],"Operate the automation identity with least privilege."],
  ["D4","データの可用性を高めるバックアップ戦略の基本は。",["定期バックアップとクロスリージョン複製","単一リージョンだけに一度保存して終える","本番データを暗号化するだけで複製はしない","スナップショットは取らず自動拡張に任せる"],0,"RPO/RTO要件に合わせて設計する。","What is the basis of a backup strategy that improves data availability?",["Regular backups and cross-region replication","Store just once in a single region only","Only encrypt production data, never replicate it","Take no snapshots and rely on autoscaling"],"Design to RPO/RTO requirements."],
  ["D4","個人情報を扱う際のデータマスキングの目的は。",["機微データを保護しつつ分析を可能にする","個人情報を含む全レコードを完全に削除する","機微データを暗号鍵ごと外部へ公開する","個人情報を加工せず全利用者に見せる"],0,"動的データマスキングで機微値を隠す。","What is the purpose of data masking when handling personal data?",["Protect sensitive data while enabling analysis","Completely delete all records with personal data","Expose sensitive data along with its keys","Show personal data to all users unprocessed"],"Hide sensitive values with dynamic data masking."],
  ["D4","組織ポリシーの役割は。",["組織全体に制約(公開禁止等)を一括適用する","個々のリソースごとに手動で権限を割り当てる","全プロジェクトの課金を自動的に停止する","組織内の全データを暗号化して外部公開する"],0,"ガバナンスをトップダウンで強制する。","What is the role of organization policy?",["Apply constraints (e.g., no public access) org-wide at once","Manually assign permissions to each individual resource one by one","Automatically stop billing across all projects","Encrypt all org data and expose it externally"],"Enforces governance top-down."],
  ["D4","コスト最適化でストレージに有効な施策は。",["ライフサイクルで低頻度データを安価クラスへ移行","全データを常に最上位クラスに保存し続ける","アクセス頻度に関係なく毎回二重に複製して保存する","データを非圧縮のまま全リージョンへ複製する"],0,"アクセス頻度に応じてクラスを下げる。","Which is an effective storage cost-optimization measure?",["Use lifecycle to move infrequent data to cheaper classes","Always keep all data in the top storage class","Replicate and store everything twice regardless of access","Replicate uncompressed data to every region"],"Lower the class according to access frequency."]
